{"Title":"An Act relative to parking enforcement","BillNumber":"H3326","DocketNumber":"HD1552","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SWG1","Name":"Susan Williams Gifford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SWG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:20:47.06"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SWG1","Name":"Susan Williams Gifford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SWG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:20:47.06"},{"Id":"JSC1","Name":"Josh S. Cutler","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JSC1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:59:08.8266667"},{"Id":"KPL1","Name":"Kathleen R. LaNatra","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KPL1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:10:33.3333333"},{"Id":"J_M1","Name":"Joan Meschino","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/J_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:35:18.9966667"},{"Id":"MJM2","Name":"Mathew J. Muratore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJM2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-23T09:39:32.9633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3326/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Gifford of Wareham, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3326) of Susan Williams Gifford and others relative to parking ticket fines.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 20A1/2 of chapter 90, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out in lines 81 to 83, inclusive, the words \"$50, if paid within 21 days, nor shall it exceed $55, if paid thereafter, but before the parking clerk reports to the registrar, as provided below and shall not exceed $75\" and inserting in place thereof the following:- $100, if paid within 21 days, nor shall it exceed $110, if paid thereafter, but before the parking clerk reports to the registrar, as provided below and shall not exceed $150.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}